        "thought_text": "Optimize the prefix sum calculation by using a more efficient data structure, such as a Fenwick Tree (Binary Indexed Tree), to keep track of cumulative sums and quickly query the sum of any subarray. This could potentially reduce the time complexity of prefix sum calculations.",
