        "node_id": "n_14_8c1ffc",
        "thought_text": "Implement a binary search over the possible values of i to find the smallest i such that A^i contains a number >= k. This approach leverages the monotonic property of the sequence (if A^i contains a number >= k, then all subsequent A^j for j > i will also contain a number >= k) and could significantly reduce the number of iterations needed.",
